    "impacts": [
      {
        "stage": 7.3,
        "statement": "At 7.3 Feet...Water starts to come out of its bank on the Jefferson River near Silver Star and Waterloo in Madison County. The water is near the foundations of several homes. Waterloo Road and Riverside Drive have water on them. An areal flood advisory is recommended from north of Twin Bridges to north of Waterloo. (June 2017). Data only available July thru September, starting in 2018."
      }
    ]
